{
  "id": "E368",
  "title": "Out Of Phone Credit",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-10-12",
  "synopsis": "Ben’s phone suddenly stopped working. What should he do?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1175/0afc5ee1650a0fe85f61b4f75dcc37a149f44baa.mp3?1569843043",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你的手机停机了\n\n本：丽丽，我的手机怎么不能用了。你能帮我看看吗？\n丽丽：我看看。哦，你的手机欠费停机了，你看这条短信。\n本：这样啊！那怎么办？\n丽丽：别担心，我上网帮你充钱就可以了。\n本：谢谢你，丽丽！",
    "traditional": "你的手機停機了\n\n本：麗麗，我的手機怎麼不能用了。你能幫我看看嗎？\n麗麗：我看看。哦，你的手機欠費停機了，你看這條短信。\n本：這樣啊！那怎麼辦？\n麗麗：別擔心，我上網幫你充錢就可以了。\n本：謝謝你，麗麗！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Your phone has run out of credit"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，我的手机怎么不能用了。你能帮我看看吗？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，我的手機怎麼不能用了。你能幫我看看嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì wǒ de shǒu jī zěn me bù néng yòng le nǐ néng bāng wǒ kàn kan ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, why can’t I use my phone. Can you help me look at it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我看看。哦，你的手机欠费停机了，你看这条短信。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我看看。哦，你的手機欠費停機了，你看這條短信。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ kàn kan ò nǐ de shǒu jī qiàn fèi tíng jī le nǐ kàn zhè tiáo duǎn xìn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Let me see. Oh, your phone has run out of credit and been shut down, look at this text message."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：这样啊！那怎么办？",
      "traditional": "本：這樣啊！那怎麼辦？",
      "pinyin": "běn zhè yàng a nà zěn me bàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: So it’s like that! Then what should I do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：别担心，我上网帮你充钱就可以了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：別擔心，我上網幫你充錢就可以了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bié dān xīn wǒ shàng wǎng bāng nǐ chōng qián jiù kě yǐ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Don’t worry, I’ll go online to help you top it up and it will work again."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：谢谢你，丽丽！",
      "traditional": "本：謝謝你，麗麗！",
      "pinyin": "běn xiè xie nǐ lì lì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Thank you, Lili!"
    }
  ],
